@startuml lez-seq-driver-view
title LEZ-001 - Driver view renders the certified server path (proposal, R12)

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
autonumber

actor Driver as D
participant "Driver view" as UI
participant "Server-geometry renderer «new»" as R
participant "DriverController" as Ctl
participant "RouteSendService" as Send
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "OSRM (public)" as O

D -> UI : open route
UI -> Ctl : GET /api/v1/driver/routes/{sendId}
Ctl -> Send : driverRoute(sendId)
Send -> Send : existing ownership check (send belongs to this driver)
Send -> DB : route stops + geometryToNext + instructionsToNext\n+ zone flags of stops
DB --> Send : data
Send --> UI : DriverRouteDTO (+ legs, + inZone per stop)
UI -> R : draw legs (decode polylines), mark in-zone stops
UI -> UI : maneuver list from stored instructions
UI -[#gray]x O : no OSRM call for this route
note right of R
  The path shown is the path that
  ComplianceChecker certified.
end note
@enduml
